  "description": "<p><strong>Brand Introduction:</strong><br>Healthy SEN is redefining the tortilla industry by bringing real food back to the table. Our mission is to craft tortillas made from whole, clean ingredients&mdash;without fillers, flours, gums, or unnecessary additives&mdash;so you can enjoy a healthier, more natural option.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Product Description:</strong><br>Our tortillas are made primarily from <strong>whole cassava root</strong>, with a touch of <strong>whole corn</strong>, <strong>extra virgin olive oil,</strong> and a pinch of salt. Unlike other options, we don&rsquo;t use refined flours, preservatives, or artificial ingredients&mdash;just real food that delivers an authentic taste and texture.</p>\r\n<p><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong><br>We are the <strong>ONLY</strong> tortilla made from <strong>whole cassava root</strong>, with no flours, fillers, or gums. Our tortillas are 100% gluten-free, allergen-free, and crafted with premium, natural ingredients for a cleaner, healthier choice.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><br>We offer competitive commissions and timely payouts for affiliate partners. Specific terms can be discussed upon approval.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Other Information:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Available in <strong>nearly 40+ retail locations across South Florida</strong> and growing rapidly.</li>\r\n<li>Trusted by health-conscious consumers looking for clean, natural tortillas.</li>\r\n<li>High demand in the gluten-free and better-for-you food space.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Join us in promoting <strong>a real-food revolution</strong> with Healthy SEN! 🚀</p>",
